flowchart TD
    facts[Profile evidence and untrusted JD] --> writer[Writer or revised draft]
    skill[One hash-verified skill procedure] --> writer
    writer --> gates[Provenance, skill-naming, numeric-evidence]
    gates -->|Pass| review[Blocking fact-check and advisory review]
    gates -.->|Fail| revise[Bounded revision]
    review -.->|Fail| revise
    revise -.-> writer
    review -->|Pass verdict and score threshold| save[Accepted version; separate PDF rendering]
    %% Internal attempts retain history; external submission saves only accepted drafts.
